            "review_title": "Review at Italiani's Pizza Ben Thanh",
            "review_text": "Pobashen N\n6 contributions\n0\nBen Thanh Italiani's (thank you)\nMay 2026 • Friends\nAgain another special treat from Italiani's. Thank you to all the staff and the manager \"Rambo\" for a special night with friends travelling through Vietnam. \n\nFood was consistent. Ordered the usual chicken teriyaki and tuna and mayo. Amazing set up, vibe was awesome and a lovely location. \n\nHighly recommend the venue 💫 . Thanks Mr Rambo\nRead more\nWritten May 18, 2026",
